ify":"\"书房\""},{"id":"cne_p075_q2","topicId":"cne_p075","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：The cat is in the bedroom. 哪一句和文字一致？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"猫在厨房。"},{"key":"B","text":"猫在卧室。"},{"key":"C","text":"猫在书房。"},{"key":"D","text":"妈妈在卧室。"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"bedroom 是卧室。","verify":"\"猫在卧室。\""},{"id":"cne_p075_q3","topicId":"cne_p075","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：Where is Amy? She is in the bathroom. Amy 在哪里？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"书房"},{"key":"B","text":"厨房"},{"key":"C","text":"卫生间"},{"key":"D","text":"卧室"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"bathroom 是卫生间。","verify":"\"卫生间\""},{"id":"cne_p075_q4","topicId":"cne_p075","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：They are in the living room. 这句说他们在客厅。哪一个词是「他们」？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"She"},{"key":"B","text":"He"},{"key":"C","text":"It"},{"key":"D","text":"They"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"They 表示他们。","verify":"\"They\""},{"id":"cne_p214_q1","topicId":"cne_p214","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"哪个单词的意思是「医院」？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"hospital"},{"key":"B","text":"park"},{"key":"C","text":"shop"},{"key":"D","text":"library"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"hospital 是医院。","verify":"\"hospital\""},{"id":"cne_p214_q2","topicId":"cne_p214","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"library 的意思是？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"公园"},{"key":"B","text":"商店"},{"key":"C","text":"学校"},{"key":"D","text":"图书馆"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"library 是图书馆。","verify":"\"图书馆\""},{"id":"cne_p214_q3","topicId":"cne_p214","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"「公园」用哪个词？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"hospital"},{"key":"B","text":"zoo"},{"key":"C","text":"park"},{"key":"D","text":"shop"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"park 是公园。","verify":"\"park\""},{"id":"cne_p214_q4","topicId":"cne_p214","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"We can buy things in a ____.","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"library"},{"key":"B","text":"shop"},